      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/woodward_iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name changed from Colton to Woodward after another town already claimed the original name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/woodward_iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Woodward officially incorporated on October 13, 1883, joining the Des Moines–West Des Moines Metropolitan Statistical Area.",
